@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Expression IR semantic trust boundary

rectangle "Typed frontend facts\nordered operands + resolved identity" as Facts #D0EBFF
rectangle "Explicit semantic profile\n10 required dimensions" as Profile #FFF3BF
rectangle "Iterative lowering machine\nheap worklist + exact caps" as Lowerer #D3F9D8
database "Flat postorder IR\nchildren precede parents" as Arena #E5DBFF
rectangle "Complete lowering?\n<<decision>>" as CompletionGate #FFD8A8
rectangle "Pure subtree and\nnamed law permitted?\n<<decision>>" as EligibilityGate #FFD8A8
rectangle "Identity-only evidence\nno equivalence claim" as Identity #FFE3E3
rectangle "Typed rewrite certificate\nall premises retained" as Certificate #C3FAE8
rectangle "Incomplete report\nlimit or malformed reason" as Incomplete #FFEC99
rectangle "Canonical serialization\nstructure only" as Serialization #D0EBFF
rectangle "Persisted identity-only IR\nrewrite authority revoked" as Persisted #FFE3E3

Facts -[#1971C2]-> Lowerer : typed facts only
Profile -[#E67700]-> Lowerer : declared semantics
Lowerer -[#2B8A3E]-> Arena : append postorder
Arena -[#6741D9]-> CompletionGate
CompletionGate -[#2B8A3E]-> EligibilityGate : yes
CompletionGate -[#C92A2A]-> Incomplete : no
EligibilityGate -[#2B8A3E]-> Certificate : yes
EligibilityGate -[#C92A2A]-> Identity : no
Arena -[#1971C2]-> Serialization : serde
Serialization -[#C92A2A]-> Persisted : deserialize
Persisted -[#C92A2A]-> Identity : certification denied

note bottom of Lowerer #E7F5FF
No parser, source-text inference,
native recursion, or semantic fallback
end note

note bottom of Persisted #FFF9DB
Bytes cannot re-prove the originating
CPG, frontend facts, or live validation.
end note
@enduml
